        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Andover, Massachusetts; Essex County; Massachusetts; United States; New England\n- Concepts: New England town; local government; municipal corporations; civil townships\n\nFacts:\n- Andover is a town in Essex County, Massachusetts, United States.\n- In the six New England states, a New England town is the basic unit of local government and local division of state authority.\n- New England towns cover the entire area of a state.\n- New England towns are similar to civil townships in other states where those exist.\n- New England towns are fully functioning municipal corporations with powers similar to cities in other states.",
